{
  "version": "1.0",
  "page": "catalog",
  "route": "/#catalog",
  "ui_language": "ru",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "catalog_header",
      "type": "MARKET_CONTEXT_HEADER",
      "title": "Режим рынка и контекст",
      "grid": {
        "xl": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 0,
          "w": 12,
          "h": 2
        }
      },
      "data_source": "/v1/market/status?window=30m",
      "realtime": "market.status.updated"
    },
    {
      "id": "catalog_filters",
      "type": "FILTER_BAR",
      "title": "Фильтры и пресеты",
      "grid": {
        "xl": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 2,
          "w": 12,
          "h": 1
        }
      },
      "filters": [
        "q",
        "action",
        "market_regime",
        "edgeRank_min",
        "conf_min",
        "profit_min_pct",
        "liq_min",
        "depth_min",
        "ar_min",
        "lp_max",
        "active_lots_min",
        "active_lots_max",
        "listed_share_min",
        "listed_share_max",
        "preset"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "catalog_table",
      "type": "TABLE_CATALOG_PRO",
      "title": "Каталог (PRO)",
      "grid": {
        "xl": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 3,
          "w": 9,
          "h": 10
        }
      },
      "data_source": "/v1/catalog/feed",
      "realtime": "catalog.row",
      "columns": [
        "variant_label",
        "floor_ton",
        "fair_ton",
        "undervalue_pct",
        "expected_profit_pct",
        "edgeRank100",
        "conf_pct",
        "liquidity_score",
        "absorption_30m",
        "listing_pressure",
        "depth_score",
        "active_lots",
        "listed_share",
        "market_regime",
        "action",
        "updated_at",
        "age_sec"
      ],
      "default_sort": [
        "sort_key desc",
        "edgeRank100 desc",
        "expected_profit_pct desc",
        "updated_at desc"
      ],
      "row_expand": {
        "sections": [
          {
            "title": "Причины",
            "field": "reasons"
          },
          {
            "title": "Риски",
            "field": "risk_flags"
          },
          {
            "title": "Decision Trace",
            "field": "decision_trace"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "catalog_sidepanel",
      "type": "SIDE_PANEL_VARIANT_QUICK_VIEW",
      "title": "Вариант — детали",
      "grid": {
        "xl": {
          "x": 9,
          "y": 3,
          "w": 3,
          "h": 10
        }
      },
      "data_source": "/v1/catalog/variant/{variant_id}",
      "fields": [
        "variant_label",
        "floor_ton",
        "fair_ton",
        "undervalue_pct",
        "expected_profit_pct",
        "edgeRank100",
        "conf_pct",
        "liquidity_score",
        "absorption_30m",
        "listing_pressure",
        "depth_score",
        "active_lots",
        "listed_share",
        "market_regime",
        "action"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "catalog_help",
      "type": "DOC_CARD",
      "title": "Как читать Catalog",
      "grid": {
        "xl": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 13,
          "w": 12,
          "h": 2
        }
      },
      "markdown": [
        "• **EdgeRank** — фиксированный скор силы идеи.",
        "• Режим рынка влияет на **пороги BUY/SELL/WATCH/SKIP** и **пресеты/ранжирование**.",
        "• Раскрой строку, чтобы увидеть **Причины / Риски / Decision Trace**."
      ]
    }
  ]
}